"title":"Howmet Aerospace Stock Gets A Lift From Raised Revenue Outlook","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"Howmet Aerospace 股票因收入前景提高而提振"},{"title":"Howmet Aerospace Lifts 2026 Targets, Unveils First 2027 Revenue Guidance and a $5 Billion Buyback - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"Howmet Aerospace 提升 2026 年目標，公佈首份 2027 年營收指引和 50 億美元回購計畫 - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"Howmet Aerospace stock in focus after Q3 beat and outlook lift - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNaVhCYkFUeUJsUktMOTA4OElTdG0xbU9KRk5MbEpRQm5UZm5YRU5aLW1LeGEtb2h6ZkxDRUhpbXFlbkxreTdtN0x6S0NUV3dMWjFBMWlYQlEwQS1BRkswVW1RemFEVGEzWWNRLXBUeEp4aTRRemEzYjIyenZ6OVBuZXNwbEl6Snpnc1c3aEFjdERTcGdvdUpMYjlibUFPVWF4Xy1yamduOTlleHc4ekVkcXdEOFdtMVUwOEIyM01jcmtCQ00?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"第三季業績好轉且前景提升後，Howmet Aerospace 股票成為焦點 - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"Howmet Aerospace stock in focus after Q3 beat and outlook lift - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxONUNrd2FjcEhtbUZSQ2MtZXZtZFlBSnE4RzhpOVlUUWQyY25pNVpTQWppYzhLUGhtcVU1Sll3a3RHdmlTZTlxLWxFN1cwUWJHal9UZnhTR3FoZURUak5RdnZGcWphUGNaMW5XOFZ1ZHlXLXFsWTJXV1kzamZjQjJDNl83TjhPYWlvWDFsVzZRUmFmWlBBcGlsYS1CdnVUQUZZVW80bldScHppUG5udG44SlM2YjJPUmQwR3VQQUJvdmtIbEk?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"第三季業績好轉且前景提升後，Howmet Aerospace 股票成為焦點 - ad-hoc-news.de"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":11},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/4281/000000428126000012/hwm-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Howmet Aerospace Inc. is a Delaware corporation with its principal office in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania. In this report, unless the context otherwise requires, \"Howmet\", the \"Company\", \"we\", \"us\", and \"our\" refer to Howmet Aerospace Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries.","zh":"Howmet Aerospace Inc. 是一家特拉華州公司，其主要辦事處位於賓夕法尼亞州匹茲堡。在本報告中，除非上下文另有要求，「Howmet」、「本公司」、「我們」和「我們的」均指 Howmet Aerospace Inc. 及其合併子公司。"},{"en":"The Arconic Inc. Separation Transaction. On April 1, 2020, Arconic Inc. separated its businesses (the \"Arconic Inc. Separation Transaction\") into two independent, publicly traded companies: Howmet Aerospace Inc. (the new name for Arconic Inc.) and Arconic Corporation. Following this separation, Howmet retained the Engine Products, Fastening Systems, Engineered Structures, and Forged Wheels businesses; and its prior Rolled Products, Aluminum Extrusions, and Building and Construction Systems businesses were spun-off to Arconic Corporation. In connection with the Arconic Inc. Separation Transaction, Howmet and Arconic Corporation entered into several agreements that govern their post-separation relationship.","zh":"Arconic Inc. 分離交易。 2020 年 4 月 1 日，Arconic Inc. 將業務分拆為兩家獨立的上市公司：Howmet Aerospace Inc.（Arconic Inc. 的新名稱）和 Arconic Corporation。分拆後，Howmet 保留了引擎產品、緊固系統、工程結構和鍛造車輪業務；其先前的軋製產品、鋁型材以及建築和施工系統業務被分拆給 Arconic Corporation。關於 Arconic Inc. 分拆交易，Howmet 和 Arconic Corporation 簽訂了幾項協議來管理其分拆後的關係。"},{"en":"The 2017 Reincorporation in Delaware. On December 31, 2017, Arconic Inc., then a Pennsylvania corporation, changed its jurisdiction of incorporation from Pennsylvania to Delaware.","zh":"2017 年在特拉華州重組。 2017 年 12 月 31 日，當時的賓州公司 Arconic Inc. 將其註冊管轄地從賓州變更為德拉瓦州。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Aerospace (Commercial and Defense) Market. Howmet's largest market is aerospace, which represented approximately 70% of the Company's revenue in 2025. The Company produces a range of high performance multi-materials, highly engineered products, and vertically integrated machined solutions for aero engines and airframe structures, ranging from investment castings, advanced coatings, seamless rings, forgings, titanium extrusions, and titanium mill products, to fasteners that hold aircraft together. Wingtip to wingtip, nose to tail, Howmet can produce more than 90% of all structural and rotating aero engine components. Modernization of the commercial and defense platforms is driven by an array of challenging performance requirements. With its precision engineering, materials science expertise, and advanced manufacturing processes, Howmet aims to help its customers achieve greater fuel econo","zh":"航空航太（商業和國防）市場。 Howmet 最大的市場是航空航天，約占公司 2025 年收入的 70%。該公司為航空發動機和機身結構生產一系列高性能多材料、高度工程化的產品和垂直集成加工解決方案，範圍從熔模鑄件、先進塗層、無縫環、鍛件、鈦擠壓件和鈦銑削產品，到將飛機固定在一起的緊固件。從翼尖到翼尖，從機頭到機尾，Howmet 可以生產 90% 以上的所有結構和旋轉航空發動機部件。商業和國防平台的現代化是由一系列具有挑戰性的性能要求所驅動的。憑藉其精密工程、材料科學專業知識和先進的製造工藝，Howmet 旨在幫助客戶實現更大的燃油經濟性"}],"competition":[{"en":"The Company's segments - Engine Products, Fastening Systems, Engineered Structures, and Forged Wheels - are subject to substantial and intense competition in the markets they serve. Although Howmet believes its advanced technology, manufacturing processes, and experience provide advantages to Howmet's customers, such as high quality and superior mechanical properties that meet the Company's customers' most stringent requirements, many of the products Howmet makes can be produced by competitors using similar types of manufacturing processes as well as alternative forms of manufacturing. Despite intense competition, Howmet continues as a market leader in most of its principal markets. We believe that factors such as Howmet's technological expertise, state-of-the-art capabilities, capacity, quality, engaged employees, and long-standing customer relationships enable the Company to maintain i","zh":"該公司的引擎產品、緊固系統、工程結構和鍛造車輪等業務部門在其所服務的市場中面臨激烈的競爭。儘管 Howmet 相信其先進的技術、製造流程和經驗為 Howmet 的客戶提供了優勢，例如滿足公司客戶最嚴格要求的高品質和卓越的機械性能，但 Howmet 製造的許多產品可以由競爭對手使用類似類型的製造流程以及替代製造形式生產。儘管競爭激烈，Howmet 在大多數主要市場仍保持市場領導者的地位。我們相信，Howmet 的技術專長、最先進的能力、產能、品質、敬業的員工以及長期的客戶關係等因素使公司能夠保持領先地位。"},{"en":"Principal competitors include Berkshire Hathaway Inc., through its 2016 acquisition of Precision Castparts Corporation and subsidiaries, for titanium and titanium-based alloys, precision forgings, seamless rolled rings, investment castings, including airfoils, and aerospace fasteners; VSMPO (Russia) for titanium and titanium-based alloys and precision forgings; ATI Inc.'s High-Performance Materials & Components segment for titanium and titanium-based alloys and precision forgings; Lisi Aerospace (France) for aerospace fasteners; and Aubert & Duval (part of Airbus, Safran, and Tikehau Capital) for precision forgings. Other competitors include Doncasters Group Limited (U.K.) and Consolidated Precision Products Corp. (owned by Warburg Pincus and Berkshire Partners) for investment castings; Weber Metals, Inc. (part of Otto Fuchs) for precision forgings; and Forgital Group and Frisa (Mexico) ","zh":"主要競爭對手包括伯克希爾哈撒韋公司（Berkshire Hathaway Inc.），該公司於 2016 年收購了 Precision Castparts Corporation 及其子公司，生產鈦及鈦基合金、精密鍛件、無縫軋製環、熔模鑄件（包括翼型件）和航空緊固件； Aerospace（法國），生產航空航太緊固件； Aubert & Duval（空中巴士公司、賽峰集團和 Tikehau Capital 的一部分）提供精密鍛件。其他競爭對手包括 Doncasters Group Limited（英國）和 Consolidated Precision Products Corp.（由 Warburg Pincus 和 Berkshire Partners 擁有）從事熔模鑄造業務； Weber Metals, Inc.（Otto Fuchs 的一部分）生產精密鍛造件；以及 Forgital Group 和 Frisa（墨西哥）"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Engine Products","val":4327000000,"zh":"引擎產品部門"},{"name":"Fastening Systems","val":1746000000,"zh":"緊固系統"},{"name":"Engineered Structures","val":1157000000,"zh":"工程結構"},{"name":"Forged Wheels","val":1039000000,"zh":"鍛造輪轂"}],"total":8252000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Aerospace Commercial","val":4322000000,"zh":"航空航太商業"},{"name":"Aerospace Defense","val":1409000000,"zh":"航空航天防禦"},{"name":"Commercial Transportation","val":1248000000,"zh":"商業運輸"},{"name":"Gas Turbines","val":944000000,"zh":"瓦斯渦輪機"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":329000000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":8252000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":4377000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Geographical Regions","val":1025000000,"zh":"其他地理區域"},{"name":"FR","val":625000000,"zh":"FR"},{"name":"JP","val":513000000,"zh":"日本"},{"name":"DE","val":439000000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"GB","val":376000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"IT","val":264000000,"zh":"它"},{"name":"CA","val":187000000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"MX","val":166000000,"zh":"墨西哥"},{"name":"PL","val":150000000,"zh":"PL"}],"total":8252000000}},"peers":["LHX","TDG","AXON","FIX","APH"]}}